sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Source account
    participant M as Mediator (shared, operator-funded)
    participant API as API (mediator co-sign)
    participant D as Destination (exchange deposit)

    Note over S,API: The API builds one atomic transaction: AccountMerge + forward Payment
    Note over S: Browser verify() confirms the merge goes to the mediator, then signs op1
    Note over API: Co-signs op2 (mediator forward) after validating the exact shape
    S->>M: op1 AccountMerge (transfers all XLM into the mediator)
    M->>D: op2 Payment (forwards funds, with required memo)
    Note over D: Exchange credits the user by address + memo
    Note over M: Shared mediator, funded once and reused - only ~1 XLM reserve, not per close
